"use strict";(globalThis.webpackChunkgrc||=[]).push([[51328],{43889(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"citeKey":"jin2010remem","slug":"jin-2010-remem-3b25","title":"REMEM: REmote MEMory as Checkpointing Storage","authors":["H. Jin","X.-H. Sun","Y. Chen","T. Ke"],"venue":"The 2nd International Conference on Cloud Computing, Indianapolis, IN, USA","type":"Conference","entryType":"inproceedings","date":"November, 2010","year":2010,"era":"iit","month":11,"doi":"10.1109/cloudcom.2010.102","abstract":"Checkpointing is a widely used mechanism for supporting fault tolerance, but notorious in its high-cost disk access. The idea of memory-based checkpointing has been extensively studied in research but made little success in practice due to its complexity and potential reliability concerns. In this study we present the design and implementation of REMEM, a REmote MEMory checkpointing system to extend the checkpointing storage from disk to remote memory. A unique feature of REMEM is that it can be integrated into existing disk-based checkpointing systems seamlessly. A user can flexibly switch between REMEM and disk as checkpointing storage to balance the efficiency and reliability. The imple- mentation of REMEM on Open MPI is also introduced. The experimental results confirm that REMEM and the proposed adaptive checkpointing storage selection are promising in both performance, reliability and scalability.","hasAbstract":true,"lede":"In this study we present the design and implementation of REMEM, a REmote MEMory checkpointing system to extend the checkpointing storage from disk to remote memory.","links":{"pdf":"https://grc.iit.edu/papers/2010/jin-2010-remem-3b25.pdf"},"_projectIds":[],"grcSelected":false,"status":"published","visibility":"public","projectIds":["fence"],"memberAuthors":["sun-xian-he"]}')}}]);